<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπῑπ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stare at,</i> with collat. notion of spying,
				<i>watch,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπιπεύσεις δὲ γυναῖκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.67
				</span></i>
			 ; or of fear, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί δ᾽ ὀπιπεύεις
				πολέμοιο γεφύρας</span> ; <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.371
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>watch, spy,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ γάρ σ᾽ ἐθέλω βαλέειν . . λάθρῃ
					ὀπιπεύσας, ἀλλ᾽ ἀμφαδόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					7.243
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ μάλ᾽ ὀπιπεύοντα . . βάλλειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					806
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Musae.
				101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				249
			</span></i> :—
				Med.
			, <i>to be on the alert,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				10.26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>seduce,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Man.
				3.196
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δολεροῖσιν -ευθεῖσαι ἔπεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.182
				</span></i>
			. (Redupl. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπ-,</span> cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄπ-ωπα.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
